        <h1 class="mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-body-secondary fst-italic mb-4">Last updated: [Date]</p>

        <section>
            <h2 class="h4 mb-3">1. Controller</h2>
            <p>The controller within the meaning of the GDPR is:</p>
            <div class="card mb-3">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <address class="mb-0">
                        Stephan Emmermann<br/>
                        Trading as NetAi<br/>
                        Sandfurttrift 59<br/>
